## Model card

- **Name:** GPT-6.2 Sol (unreleased — sightings only)
- **Short description:** OpenAI's rumored mid-tier successor to GPT-6.1 Sol. As of 2026-11-13 it has never shipped: the model does not appear in OpenAI's API changelog (checked through 2026-11-05 entries), model docs, or pricing pages; the only traces are a Google Cloud Console Quotas-page sighting of `gpt-6.2-sol` (2026-11-04, user report), Codex usage breakdowns mentioning `gpt-6.2-astra`/`gpt-6.2-sol` (Nov 1–2), and a The Information report (paywalled) that GPT-6.2 "could come as soon as Friday" in Astra, Sol and Cyber versions.
- **Provider / access:** none — not announced, not callable, no API route. OpenAI itself has said nothing.
- **Release / knowledge:** not released. GPT-6 Sol released 2026-09-22 ($2/$10); GPT-6.1 Sol 2026-09-29 ($2/$0.10 cached/$10; ~matches GPT-6 Astra at lower cost); GPT-6 Cyber 2026-11-05. GPT-6.2 has no date.
- **IDs:** `gpt-6.2-sol` (seen on Google Cloud quotas; unconfirmed; OpenAI has published no ID).
- **Context window:** unpublished (meta.json claims 1.05M / 128K out — unverified, not evidence).
- **Modalities:** unpublished (presumed text/image/file in, text out, reasoning).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-13):** none published. (GPT-6.1 Sol: $2 in / $10 out per 1M; prompts >272K tokens priced at higher rates.)
- **Architecture:** unpublished.

